OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a chilly start for some,
OL,6,Fsoon warming up with sunny spells.
OL,7,FSunshine will be hazy at times, with
OL,8,Fsome higher cloud, but remaining dry.
OL,9,FFeeling much warmer than on Friday
OL,10,Fwith only a light breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA warm evening with plenty of
OL,13,Fsunshine. Dry overnight with clear
OL,14,Fperiods, although cloud thickening
OL,15,Ffrom the north during the early hours
OL,16,Fof Sunday. Warmer than recent nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
