OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FStaying generally dry but the
OL,6,Fodd spot of rain is possible over the
OL,7,FPennines. Dry and very warm elsewhere
OL,8,Fwith periods of hazy sunshine. Breezy
OL,9,Fat times during the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FPerhaps the odd shower overnight, but
OL,13,Fsoon clearing Monday morning. A mostly
OL,14,Fdry, sunny and warm week follows.
OL,15,FPotentially turning hot by Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
